{title: I must be saved}
{x_theme: salvation}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/I must be saved.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I must be saved, I must be saved
I must be saved, for Jesus saves
Forgive me Lord, Hide all my sins
I must be saved for Him

{comment: Verse 1}
In all my sins, there was not one who cared
How far my soul was from Jesus
In silent deep, with my soul in despair
Sweetly a voice whispered Jesus

{comment: Verse 2}
Once I though I would wait til old age
Then I’d surrender and be steady
Then came the thought what if God called my soul
And deep in sin I’m not ready.
